==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Hoothoot|143}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
**Both cards have {{m|Wing Attack}}; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Hoothoot}} can learn.
*{{a|Insomnia}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Hoothoot}} can have.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

